flowchart TD
    A[Load one folder or upload five CSV files] --> B[Normalize master tables and patch versions]
    B --> C[Set model, reasoning, thresholds, and task prompt]
    C --> D[Click 생성형 AI Agent 실행]
    D --> E[LLM selects tool]
    E --> F[Validate and execute tool]
    F --> G[Return structured evidence and append safe trace]
    G --> H{More evidence needed?}
    H -->|yes, within limits| E
    H -->|no| I[Generate final analysis]
    I --> J{Virtual patch note exists?}
    J -->|yes| K[Ensure scenario estimate and self-reflection]
    J -->|no| L[Show missing-stage warning]
    K --> M[Show HITL review form]
    L --> M
    M --> N{Human decision}
    N --> O[Pending / Approve candidate / Reject / Needs Revision / Retest / Save Candidate]
    O --> P[Persist review record]
    F -->|validation, timeout, API, or empty result| Q[Expose failure in trace or UI]
    Q --> R[Revise input, collect data, or rerun]
